You can now streamline the way you organize and manage your information =
with Creately=E2=80=99s powerful and flexible notes.

They are effortlessly integrated with your workspaces and items, allowing =
you to provide additional detail and context to your projects and ideas =
seamlessly.=C2=A0

**Adding details to elements**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

You can provide additional details to any item on the workspace - be it a =
step in a process map or a card in a Kanban board - using notes.=C2=A0

**Rich text formatting=C2=A0**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=


You can choose from a wide variety of formatting options to structure your =
content and make it more easy-to-read and interact with.=C2=A0

**Embedding media content**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D

Provide additional references for your ideas and plans, giving more context=
 for better team collaboration and communication.=C2=A0

**Pre-made templates**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

Get a head-start with Creately starter toolkits offering pre-made templates=
 for common use cases, from project management to HR planning.=C2=A0

**Re-using notes**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

Save the notes as templates in a database for future use in different =
contexts. Add them to an existing database or create a new database.=C2=A0

